 "text": "Eaton County GIS\n-->\n-->\nSkip Navigation\nAdd to Favorites\nAdd to Favorites\nClose\nSign In\nExplore\nData\nDocuments\nApps & Maps\nRecent Downloads\nEaton County Home Page\nDownload Geodata\nParcel Records\nArcGIS Online\nHow Do I...\nMore\nEaton County Home Page\nDownload Geodata\nParcel Records\nArcGIS Online\nHow Do I...\nWelcome to Eaton County GIS.\nOur mission is to provide user-friendly mapping solutions to support informed decision-making in our community. On this site, we host a collection of interactive online maps that make visualizations of County datasets quick and intuitive. We also host an Open Data Portal where you can easily find and download GIS data for further exploration.\nNeed even more GIS power? It's as easy as 1...2...3...\n1) Get free QGIS software from https://qgis.org and install it.\n2) Download our pre-configured Open Data QGIS Map zip file from HERE.\n3) Extract the Open Data zip file and double-click the \"OpenData\" QGIS Project file.\nYou're ready to explore!\nEaton County\nContact Us\nECGIS\n911 Courthouse Dr.\nCharlotte, MI 48813\nPhone: 517-543-4714\nEmail: gis@eatoncounty.org\nHelpful Links\nECGIS Open Data Portal\nMichigan Open Data Portal\nWhere to Vote\nProperty Descriptions\nForms & Documents\nCustom Mapping & Printing Prices\nAerial Imagery Fee Schedule\nOpen Data Policy\nData License Agreement\nProperty Codes (PDF)\nLand Descriptions (PDF)\nUSGS Quadrangle Maps\n© 2026 Eaton County Michigan\nBuilt with\nArcGIS Hub\nExplore Feeds",
